1.0.2 2026-10-16
  - Signal description corrected: the data are the authors' 70-150 Hz band-passed high-gamma signal (zero mean, about half of the samples negative, 94-96 % of the power in 70-150 Hz in all 20 recordings), not a Hilbert envelope as the release metadata and the earlier README / GeneratedBy said. Data files unchanged.
  - *_ieeg.json: SoftwareFilters gives the 70-150 Hz band-pass; *_channels.tsv: low_cutoff 70, high_cutoff 150.
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.2.

